        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Czochralski process for production of monocrystalline silicon blocks. Than edges are sliced and blocks are sawn.\n\n# Included processes\nGate to gate inventory for an improved Czochralski process. Crushing of Si, etching with HNO3, HF and acetic acid. Melting in a silica pot and crystallisation to produce a monocrystalline material. Water emissions roughly estimated. Process emissions to air are not known.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
